    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d710a-15">

                <pb facs="0262" n="82" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg82"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Editor’s Note</hi></head>
                <p>—While Truman was having luncheon with Churchill,<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d710a-15-f1"/> Byrnes was a luncheon guest at Eden’s quarters in
                        Babelsberg.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d710a-15-f2"/> No record of the substance
                    of the conversation at this meeting has been found.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
